%% Sfumato v0.2 generation sequence
%% Status: PROPOSED orchestration; implemented behavior is called out in notes.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as CLI, TUI, or library client
    participant App as GenerateSlides use case [Proposed boundary]
    participant Config as ConfigResolver [Implemented behavior]
    participant Prompt as PromptCatalog [In flight]
    participant Source as SourceReader [Implemented behavior]
    participant Model as TextProvider [Implemented trait]
    participant Review as ReviewableDocument [Implemented]
    participant Render as Render ports [Implemented behavior]
    participant Tx as ArtifactTransaction [Proposed]
    participant Events as EventSink [Proposed contract]

    Client->>App: generate(request, operation_context)
    App->>Events: stage(Configuring)
    App->>Config: resolve(overrides)
    Config-->>App: ConfigSnapshot with provenance
    App->>Source: collect bounded sources
    Source-->>App: SourceBundle
    App->>Prompt: render(draft PromptPair, variables)
    Prompt-->>App: Rendered system and user prompts with provenance
    App->>Events: stage(Drafting)
    App->>Model: generate_text(prompt, tools, cancellation)
    alt provider reports context or output limit
        App->>Prompt: render(compact draft PromptPair, variables)
        App->>Model: generate_text(compact prompt, no new tools)
    end
    Model-->>App: complete draft
    App->>Review: parse and validate canonical deck
    opt semantic review enabled
        App->>Prompt: render(review PromptPair, variables)
        App->>Model: generate guarded JSON Patch
        App->>Review: test revisions, apply patch, validate
    end
    App->>Render: inspect layout
    opt focused repair improves measured overflow
        App->>Prompt: render(layout-repair PromptPair, variables)
        App->>Model: generate guarded replacement
        App->>Review: apply and validate
        App->>Render: inspect candidate again
    end
    App->>Tx: begin(artifact plan)
    App->>Render: stage Mermaid, theme, Markdown, and PDF
    Render-->>Tx: staged artifacts
    App->>Tx: validate manifest and commit
    Tx-->>App: committed ArtifactManifest
    opt publication requested
        App->>Tx: publish processed artifact
    end
    App-->>Client: GenerationResult

    Note over App,Render: Drafting, guarded review, layout checks, Mermaid rendering, and PDF export are implemented today.
    Note over App,Tx: v0.2 adds one cancellation-aware use-case boundary and a recoverable transaction.
